            "value": "它在外面时写的心愿影响下一趟；在家或待发时写的影响下下趟。每周一清空，没听懂就随便走走。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A wish written while away guides the next trip; at home or before departure, it guides the trip after that. Wishes clear on Monday. If unclear, it will wander."
